      "description": "ACADEMICS | Martin University | Indianapolis top of page Bursar Bursar (317) 543-3235 DONATE ACCREDITATION ABOUT Mission/Vision/Values History FAQ Facility Rental Human Resources GIVE ADMISSIONS Returning Students Financial Aid Bursar Plan A Visit Contact Us Consumer Information ACADEMICS Academic Advising School of Education Undergraduate Programs Stackable Credential & Certificates Graduate Programs Master of Organizational Leadership Returning Students International Students Registrar Faculty Academic Calendar Institutional Research and Effectiveness MU GLOBAL CAMPUS MARTIN WORKS Job Ready Badging Program MY MARTIN Student Services Student Disability Services Alumni Association Career Resource Center My Martin Portal Martin U Merchandise NEWS & EVENTS Martin Insider Podcast Media Campus Alerts Internet Offering Use tab to navigate through the menu items. No Inclement Weather Alerts Division of Academic Affairs Academic Calendar | Academic Advising | Undergraduate Programs | Undergraduate Course Catalog Graduate Programs | Degree Program Learning Outcomes | Institutional Research and Effectiveness Academic Calendar Meet the Provost Dr. David Brewer is a native of Portland, Oregon, who has also lived in Chicago, Philadelphia, Michigan, and now resides in Indianapolis. Within Martin University, Dr. Brewer has held prominent roles, including Lead Faculty for Business, and the Dean of the College of Business and Technology. ​ Dr. Brewer's diverse career spans 20 years in the corporate world, where he worked in human resources, training and development, computer programming and software development, project management, and business process design. Following his corporate career, he led two nonprofits—a local church collaboration network and an international business incubator. Additionally, Dr. Brewer has taught at six universities and has provided consulting services to a wide range of businesses, nonprofits, ministries, and educational institutions. He has been married for over 25 years and is the father of two sons. David Brewer, MB A, PhD provost@martin.edu Martin University Faculty Bryan Evans, Sr. Business Administration ​ bevans@martin.edu 317-917-3975 Rebecca Doane, Ph.D. Early Childhood Education Organizational Leadership ​ rdoane@martin.edu 317-917-3984 Monique Ejim, Ph.D. Psychology ​ mejim@martin.edu 317-917-3325 Marva Hunt, MSM Healthcare Management​ ​ mhunt@martin.edu 317-917-3405 Brian Steuerwald, PhD, HSPP Community Psychology ​ bsteu@martin.edu 317-917-3260 Jack Thomas, PhD, HSPP Community Psychology jthomas@martin.edu 317-917-3238 AademicCalendar Academic Information Academic Calendar Undergraduate Programs Undergraduate Course Catalog Degree Program Learning Outcomes Graduate Programs Institutional Research and Effectiveness Home ​ About Martin University Mission Leadership History FAQs Accreditation Facility Rental Human Resources COVID-19 Polic y Inclement Weather Alert Admissions How To Apply Financial Aid Bursar Consumer Information Plan A Visit Contact Us Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Department Of Students Services Prior Learning Assessment (PLA) Registrar Academic Calendar Do Not Sell My Personal Information My Martin Alumni Association My Martin News & Events Media Campus Alerts MARTIN NEWSLETTER Martin University 2186 North Sherman Drive, Indianapolis, IN 46218 ​ Phone ( 317) 917-3966 ​ Fax (317) 917-3393 ​ Administrative B uilding Hours: Monday 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Tuesday 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Wednesday 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Thursday 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Friday 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Saturday Closed Sunday Closed Career Opportunities | Donate | Request A Transcript | Contact An Enrollment Advisor | Higher Education Opportunity Act bottom of page"
